            "help_en": "The custom tag key specified by the user.\n\nThe tag key can be up to 64 characters in length, cannot start with `dw:`, and supports only letters, digits, and the following special characters: `-@#*<>|[]()+=&%$!~`",
            "help_zh": "用户输入的自定义标签键。\n\n最多支持64个字符，不能以`dw:`开头，仅支持中英文数字和部分符号`-@#*<>|[]()+=&%$!~`",
            "name": "key",
            "options": [
              "--key"
            ],
            "pattern": "^[\\u4E00-\\u9FA5A-Za-z0-9_\\-@#*<>|\\[\\]()+=&%$!~]+$",
            "raw_name": "Key",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "example": "value",
            "help_en": "The tag value",
            "help_zh": "标签值",
